            "description": {
              "content": "OAuth 2.0 authorization endpoint on the SMART App Launcher, located at https://launch.smarthealthit.org/v/r4/auth/authorize (a sibling of the /fhir base, so this path carries its own server). Initiates the SMART App Launch authorization code flow with PKCE, accepting standard OAuth parameters plus SMART launch context (launch, aud/aud-validated FHIR base, and clinical scopes such as patient/*.read, launch/patient, openid, and fhirUser). No client registration is required on the sandbox.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
